This branch is build output. Do not edit it.

Everything here is generated by bin/build-pages.php in the crmleaf
payroll tools monorepo and force-pushed by bin/publish-pages.sh. The next
publish overwrites the branch completely, so an edit made here is lost
without trace.

The page itself is demo/index.html on the main branch of this repository -
edit it there. The calculator it renders is @crmleaf/payroll-js, which is
also where the arithmetic and the statutory rate tables come from.

